{"story_id":53990,"updated_at":"2026-10-31T11:26:32","headline_en":"Mangolpuri shoe factory fire: police summon owner after blaze kills four","headline_hi":"मंगोलपुरी जूता फैक्टरी आग: आग लगने से चार लोगों की मौत के बाद पुलिस ने मालिक को समन भेजा","payload_en":{"story_id":53990,"headline":"Mangolpuri shoe factory fire: police summon owner after blaze kills four","counts":{"articles":13,"independent_sources":12,"outlets":13},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Amar Ujala","BBC Hindi","ETV Bharat","Hindustan","India TV Hindi","Jagran","NDTV","NDTV India","National Herald","Navbharat Live","Navbharat Times","News18"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":53990,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-31T11:26:32","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life","justice"],"tertiary":["weather","probes"]},"places":["delhi"],"people":["Vikram Singh","(ADO) Paras Kumar","Ashok","Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area","Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita","Delhi Fire Service","Harihar","Lal Babu"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Four people died on Friday night, and two others were injured in the fire.","ids":[84755,84769],"parts":[{"text":"Four people died on Friday night,","ids":[84755],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"and two others were injured in the fire.","ids":[84769],"class":"partial"}],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4,5]}],[{"text":"Four people died in the fire on Friday night, and four workers died due to it.","ids":[84755,84749],"parts":[{"text":"Four people died in the fire on Friday night,","ids":[84755],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"and four workers died due to it.","ids":[84749],"class":"partial"}],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,6,7]}],[{"text":"Six people were rescued from the factory (Injured After Fire Engulfs Shoe Factory) in an unconscious state on Friday night.","ids":[84774,84757],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,4,8]}],[{"text":"Two workers were injured and are undergoing treatment on Friday night, and two workers were injured in the fire.","ids":[84750,84761],"class":"single","sources":[6,7]}],[{"text":"A fire broke out at a shoe factory in Delhi Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area at 9:30 PM on Friday night, and a fire broke out at a shoe factory in Area Phase-1 on Friday night.","ids":[84768,84748],"parts":[{"text":"A fire broke out at a shoe factory in Delhi Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area at 9:30 PM on Friday night,","ids":[84768],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"and a fire broke out at a shoe factory in Area Phase-1 on Friday night.","ids":[84748],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"Factory owners Mukesh Bansal and Rohit Goyal are being questioned.","ids":[84762],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Police arrested Suresh Chand and Ashok in connection with the case.","ids":[84763],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"The deceased are identified as Premchand, Harihar, Ashok, and Lal Babu.","ids":[84766],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Four people were declared dead at Sanjay Gandhi Memorial Hospital on Friday night, Police said.","ids":[84778],"class":"unverified","sources":[5,8]},{"text":"Six people were rescued from the factory in an unconscious state, and taken to Memorial Hospital, Police said.","ids":[84774,84783],"parts":[{"text":"Six people were rescued from the factory in an unconscious state,","ids":[84774],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"and taken to Memorial Hospital, Police said.","ids":[84783],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[2,5,8]}],[{"text":"Delhi Fire Service sent 20 fire tenders to the spot after receiving information about the fire at 9:32 PM on Friday night.","ids":[84782],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"Police summoned the factory owner, DCP Vikram Singh said.","ids":[84753],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,3,4,6]},{"text":"Police were investigating the cause of the fire and the safety arrangements at the factory, Singh said.","ids":[84752],"class":"partial","sources":[2,6,8]}],[{"text":"The fire started in the basement (Fire Starts In Basement) of the factory, specifically in the footwear manufacturing unit, Assistant Divisional Officer (ADO) Paras Kumar said.","ids":[84751,84775],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"The fire was likely caused by a short-circuit, an unnamed source said.","ids":[84765],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Treatment of the other two people is ongoing at the hospital, Kumar said.","ids":[84785],"class":"partial","sources":[4,5]}],[{"text":"Police registered an FIR under sections 287, 125(A), 105, and 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita.","ids":[84767],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Police summoned the factory owner, and they are questioning the contractor and workers, Singh said.","ids":[84753,84777],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,6]}],[{"text":"Legal proceedings had been initiated and further action would follow the investigation, Singh said.","ids":[84780],"class":"single","sources":[8]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","next","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://navbharatlive.com/amp/story/delhi/delhi-mangolpuri-fire-four-dead-two-injured-shoe-factory-fire-nkr24","outlet":"Navbharat Live","title":"दिल्ली के मंगोलपुरी में भीषण अग्निकांड! जूते फैक्ट्री में 4 लोगों की दर्दनाक मौत, मालिक पर पुलिस कसेगा शिकंजा","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.news18.com/india/4-killed-2-injured-after-fire-engulfs-shoe-factory-in-delhis-mangolpuri-probe-underway-ws-l-10405909.html","outlet":"News18","title":"4 Killed, 2 Injured After Fire Engulfs Shoe Factory In Delhi's Mangolpuri, Probe Underway","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.livehindustan.com/ncr/delhi-mangolpuri-shoe-factory-fire-many-dead-and-injured-201793408726874.html