ea Phase-1.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"ETV Bharat","url":"https://www.etvbharat.com/hi/state/massive-fire-broke-out-at-shoe-factory-in-mangolpuri-four-workers-died-and-two-others-in-critical-condition-dls26103100506","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Four people died due to the fire because A fire broke out at a shoe factory in Delhi Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Navbharat Times","url":"https://navbharattimes.indiatimes.com/metro/delhi/other-news/massive-fire-in-delhi-mangolpuri-shoe-factory-4-dead-2-injured/articleshow/135383474.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Four people died and two others were injured in the fire because A fire broke out at a shoe factory in Delhi Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan","url":"https://www.livehindustan.com/ncr/delhi-mangolpuri-shoe-factory-fire-many-dead-and-injured-201793408726874.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Four people died because A fire broke out at a shoe factory in the Mangolpuri industrial area.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"NDTV","url":"https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/4-killed-2-injured-in-massive-shoe-factory-fire-in-delhi-s-mangolpuri-industrial-areea-12261769","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Six people were rescued from the factory in an unconscious state because A fire broke out at a shoe factory in the industrial area of Mangolpuri, Delhi.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"National Herald","url":"https://www.nationalheraldindia.com/national/delhi-four-killed-two-injured-after-massive-fire-breaks-out-at-shoe-factory","stance":"asserts"}]}],"context":[{"text":"Police registered an FIR under sections 287, 125(A), 105, and 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Jagran","url":"https://www.jagran.com/delhi/new-delhi-city-mangolpuri-factory-fire-4-dead-2-injured-in-delhi-shoe-unit-40422517.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Police have summoned the factory owner and are questioning the contractor and workers.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"News18","url":"https://www.news18.com/india/4-killed-2-injured-after-fire-engulfs-shoe-factory-in-delhis-mangolpuri-probe-underway-ws-l-10405909.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Legal proceedings had been initiated and further action would follow the investigation.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"National Herald","url":"https://www.nationalheraldindia.com/national/delhi-four-killed-two-injured-after-massive-fire-breaks-out-at-shoe-factory","stance":"attributes"}]}]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":53990,"headline":"मंगोलपुरी जूता फैक्टरी आग: आग लगने से चार लोगों की मौत के बाद पुलिस ने मालिक को समन भेजा","counts":{"articles":13,"independent_sources":12,"outlets":13},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Amar Ujala","BBC Hindi","ETV Bharat","Hindustan","India TV Hindi","Jagran","NDTV","NDTV India","National Herald","Navbharat Live","Navbharat Times","News18"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":53990,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-31T11:26:32","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life","justice"],"tertiary":["weather","probes"]},"places":["delhi"],"people":["Vikram Singh","(ADO) Paras Kumar","Ashok","Lokesh Mangolpuri Industrial Area","Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita","Delhi Fire Service","Harihar","Lal Babu"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"शुक्रवार रात को आग में चार लोगों की मौत हो गई और दो अन्य घायल हो गए।","ids":[84755,84769],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4,5]}],[{"text":"शुक्रवार रात को आग में चार लोगों की मौत हो गई और इसके कारण चार श्रमिकों की मौत हो गई।","ids":[84755,84749],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,6,7]}],[{"text":"शुक्रवार रात को फैक्ट्री (Injured After Fire Engulfs Shoe Factory) से छह लोगों को बेहोश हालत में बचाया गया।","ids":[84774,84757],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,4,8]}],[{"text":"शुक्रवार रात को दो श्रमिक घायल हो गए और उनका इलाज चल रहा है, तथा दो श्रमिक आग में घायल हो गए।","ids":[84750,84761],"class":"single","sources":[6,7]}],[{"text":"शुक्रवार रात को 9:30 बजे दिल्ली के के मंगोलपुरी इंडस्ट्रियल एरिया स्थित एक जूता फैक्ट्री में आग लग गई, और शुक्रवार रात को एरिया फेज-1 स्थित एक जूता फैक्ट्री में आग लग गई।","ids":[84768,84748],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"फैक्टरी मालिकों मुकेश बंसल और रोहित गोयल से पूछताछ की जा रही है।","ids":[84762],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"पुलिस ने मामले के संबंध में सुरेश चंद और अशोक को गिरफ्तार किया।","ids":[84763],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"मृतकों की पहचान प्रेमचंद, हरिहर, अशोक और लाल बाबू के रूप में हुई है।","ids":[84766],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"पुलिस ने बताया कि शुक्रवार रात को संजय गांधी मेमोरियल अस्पताल में चार लोगों को मृत घोषित कर दिया गया।","ids":[84778],"class":"unverified","sources":[5,8]},{"text":"पुलिस ने बताया कि छह लोगों को फैक्ट्री से बेहोश हालत में बचाया गया और मेमोरियल अस्पताल ले जाया गया।","ids":[84774,84783],"class":"single","sources":[2,5,8]}],[{"text":"दिल्ली फायर सेवा ने शुक्रवार रात को 9:32 बजे आग की सूचना मिलने के बाद मौके पर 20 दमकल गाड़ियां भेजीं।","ids":[84782],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"डीसीपी विक्रम सिंह ने बताया कि पुलिस ने फैक्ट्री मालिक को तलब किया।","ids":[84753],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,3,4,6]},{"text":"सिंह ने बताया कि पुलिस आग लगने के कारणों और फैक्ट्री में सुरक्षा व्यवस्था की जांच कर रही थी।","ids":[84752],"class":"partial","sources":[2,6,8]}],[{"text":"असिस्टेंट डिविजनल ऑफिसर (ADO) पारस कुमार ने बताया कि आग फैक्ट्री के बेसमेंट (Fire Starts In Basement) में, विशेष रूप से जूता निर्माण इकाई में शुरू हुई।","ids":[84751,84775],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"एक अज्ञात सूत्र ने बताया कि आग संभवतः शॉर्ट-सर्किट के कारण लगी थी।","ids":[84765],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"कुमार ने बताया कि अस्पताल में अन्य दो लोगों का इलाज जारी है।","ids":[84785],"class":"partial","sources":[4,5]}],[{"text":"पुलिस ने भारतीय न्याय संहिता की धाराओं 287, 125(ए), 105 और 3(5) के तहत एफआईआर दर्ज की।","ids":[84767],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"सिंह ने बताया कि पुलिस ने फैक्ट्री मालिक को तलब किया, और वे ठेकेदार तथा श्रमिकों से पूछताछ कर रहे हैं।","ids":[84753,84777],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,6]}],[{"text":"सिंह ने बताया कि कानूनी कार्यवाही शुरू कर दी गई थी और जांच के बाद आगे की कार्रवाई की जाएगी।","ids":[84780],"class":"single","sources":[8]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","next","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://navbharatlive.com/amp/story/delhi/delhi-mangolpuri-fire-four-dead-two-injured-shoe-factory-fire-nkr24","outlet":"Navbharat Live","title":"दिल्ली के मंगोलपुरी में भीषण अग्निकांड! जूते फैक्ट्री में 4 लोगों की दर्दनाक मौत, मालिक पर पुलिस कसेगा शिकंजा","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.news18.com/india/4-killed-2-injured-after-fire-engulfs-shoe-factory-in-delhis-mangolpuri-probe-underway-ws-l-10405909.html","outlet":"News18","title":"4 Killed, 2 Injured After Fire Engulfs Shoe Factory In Delhi's Mangolpuri, Probe Underway","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.livehindustan.com/ncr/delhi-mangolpuri-shoe-factory-fire-many-dead-and-injured-201793408726874.html","outlet":"Hindustan","title":"दिल्ली के मंगोलपुरी में जूता फैक्ट्री में भीषण आग, 4 लोगों की मौत, 2 घायल","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/4-killed-2-injured-in-massive-shoe-factory-fire-in-delhi-s-mangolpuri-industrial-areea-12261769","outlet":"NDTV","title":"4 Killed, 2 Injured In Massive Shoe Factory Fire In Delhi's Mangolpuri","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://navb